      "content": "It's critical to maintain model performance while addressing legal concerns. One approach could be to run a comparison between the old and new models using a separate test set. This would provide a direct assessment of any changes in predictive accuracy. Moreover, you can prioritize ongoing monitoring of the cancer drug candidates' predictions during the transition to evaluate performance in real-time. If there is a noticeable drop, we may need to consider a phased approach or later adjustments. Let's prepare to address the data and findings methodically as we go along.",
